7.3 The Readiness Rule

Rule A9-R1 (No Partial Submission). A dossier is submitted only when all applicable layers are complete. Partial submissions are rejected.

Rule A9-R2 (Gap Documentation). Any requirement without a covering artifact is documented as a gap and tracked to closure.

Rule A9-R3 (Independent Review). The readiness assessment is reviewed by a party independent of the development team.

